<title>USA: First Data to acquire Donnelly Marketing.</title>
<headline>First Data to acquire Donnelly Marketing.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Data Corp said on Thursday that it has an agreement to acquire Chicago-based Donnelley Marketing Inc, a direct marketing firm for $185 million.</p>
<p>Donnelly was purchased in 1991 by a private Chicago-based investment firm from Dun &amp; Bradstreet Corp.</p>
